+ * that repeats the sub-command; CAPABILITIES is answered with
+ * MotorExtCapabilities (8 bytes) instead. Nothing is sent spontaneously: the
+ * host polls STATUS to follow a move.
+ * ------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
